lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI首款AI硬件细节曝光：甜甜圈造型、售价300至400美元，预计2027年发布</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">ChatGPT 接入 Adobe 全家桶，支持 70 多款创意工具一句话调用</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Alphabet计划举债250亿美元，软银以OpenAI股份抵押贷款100亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布离线翻译硬件 Gemma Translator，基于树莓派运行 51 亿参数模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c98465b9990f07b5c8d75ae0e9f5b496.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌 Creative Lab 团队于 8 月 6 日推出离线翻译设备 Gemma Translator，该设备基于 Raspberry Pi 5 单板计算机开发，全程无需联网即可实现跨语种语音翻译。核心模型采用谷歌 Gemma 4E2B，总参数量 51 亿，激活参数量 23 亿，专为资源受限的边缘设备优化。系统通过 LiteRT-LM 框架执行翻译推理，并集成 Moonshine AI 模型处理本地语音转写与合成。用户通过麦克风输入语音后，设备可实时在显示器输出译文并由扬声器播报。该产品展示了端侧模型从实验室演示走向独立成品的可行路径，证明了在边缘计算环境下，无需依赖云端 API 即可实现高效、实时的离线翻译交互，为开发者提供了边缘 AI 应用的硬件参考范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">字节跳动拟训练超5万亿参数大模型，规模或将刷新国内纪录</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d920e5095af766f1e5bde33cf9dac4e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">字节跳动正处于训练超5万亿参数大模型的早期讨论阶段，该模型若成功落地，将成为国内已知规模最大的大模型，性能目标对标GPT-5.6或Opus 5级别。在算力需求方面，以H100显卡为基准，训练5万亿参数模型需百万张显卡运行35天，或10万张显卡运行347天。考虑到算力部署效率，字节跳动预计将通过20万至30万张显卡进行为期3至4个月的训练，叠加后训练等环节，模型成型周期至少需半年至一年。此次研发旨在显著提升豆包大模型的逻辑推理与综合智商，以缩小与OpenAI及Anthropic等头部厂商在超大规模模型领域的差距。目前行业核心挑战在于，如此高昂的算力投入能否在商业落地端实现对等的经济回报，这直接决定了该项目的最终发布进程。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI首款AI硬件细节曝光：甜甜圈造型、售价300至400美元，预计2027年发布</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/52d3f21132ebb785afc1bf5c7019f1ff.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正与前苹果设计师Jony Ive合作开发首款自有AI硬件，该产品预计于2027年发布，定价在300至400美元之间。设备外形呈“甜甜圈”造型，体积约为冰球大小，设计定位为无显示屏的家庭智能音箱。硬件配置包含摄像头、传感器及可自动移动的机械部件，用于提示响应状态。交互方面，该设备运行机制类似于ChatGPT的语音模式，但将搭载更先进的LLM以实现更自然的类人交流。作为OpenAI首款自研硬件，其核心目标是提供便携的家庭陪伴体验，通过Jony Ive的工业设计能力在AI硬件赛道建立差异化竞争优势。此次产品研发标志着OpenAI正式将对话AI技术从软件层面延伸至硬件载体，旨在通过自然语音交互重塑家庭场景下的AI应用体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT 接入 Adobe 全家桶，支持 70 多款创意工具一句话调用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b947ac5e91223bb3eb606c2aa8ca4bc1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Adobe 与 OpenAI 合作大幅扩容，用户现可在 ChatGPT 中直接调用 Photoshop、Premiere、Acrobat、Lightroom、Illustrator 和 InDesign 等 70 多款 Adobe 工具。自 8 月 6 日起，用户在 ChatGPT 插件页面添加 Adobe 插件后，通过输入“@Adobe”加具体任务指令，即可完成照片编辑、视频制作及 PDF 生成等操作。该插件支持与 OpenAI 的 Codex 及 Work 套件协同，登录 Creative Cloud 账户后可同步云端文件并调用 Adobe Firefly 生成式 AI 模型。Adobe 官方表示，此举旨在将专业级工具嵌入 AI 原生工作流，但强调插件并非旗舰应用的替代品，复杂操作仍需在旗舰软件中完成。此次</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Alphabet计划举债250亿美元，软银以OpenAI股份抵押贷款100亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9c890e99ed5addd286fc9001673230f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Alphabet与软银近期通过大规模债务融资加码AI布局。Alphabet计划发行期限涵盖2年至40年的十份债券，筹集200至250亿美元资金，旨在支撑数据中心扩建、TPU研发及模型训练等核心AI业务，其中40年期债券利率较美国国债高出1.3个百分点。与此同时，软银集团通过愿景基金2号全资子公司，向由高盛、摩根大通等组成的银团签署了100亿美元的2年期抵押贷款协议，抵押物为软银持有的OpenAI股份。此举在保留OpenAI股权收益空间的同时获取了即期流动性。两家巨头选择债务融资而非股权融资，旨在锁定融资成本并避免稀释股权，以应对AI基础设施建设高资本开支、长回报周期的行业特性。这种高杠杆融资模式反映了AI军备竞赛对资金的极度渴求，同时也伴随着估值波动带来的潜在平仓风险。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
